  "summary": "Vigilant Solutions announced an agreement with MVTRAC to expand the commercial license-plate-reader data available to law enforcement through its LEARN platform, bringing access to over 3 billion historical scans and 100 million new scans monthly. The press release emphasizes that the data contains no personal information and is gathered legally in public areas.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Vigilant Solutions announces today that it has reached an agreement with MVTRAC that will enable law enforcement to have greater access to commercially-generated license plate reader (LPR) data via its hosted LEARN\u00ae analytic software to assist in law enforcement investigations.",
      "paragraph_idx": 2
    },
    {
      "quote": "law enforcement customers to have access to well over 3 billion historical LPR scans and over 100 million new LPR scans monthly",
      "paragraph_idx": 3
    },
    {
      "quote": "Law enforcement generated data is never shared with or sold to commercial entities.",
      "paragraph_idx": 6
    }
  ],
